 VR (SteamVR)Online co-op through Steam, 1 to 4 playersThe demo has been up for some time but I have been focused on fixing reported issues and improvements and decided to wait to do the official announcement. I will post patch notes soon deta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040859","verified_at":"2026-10-25T02:08:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1587920-1842846814444678","game_id":"steam-1587920","kind":"announcement","title":"Undead Development 2 gameplay trailer","summary":"Preview the content to expect coming in Early Access. Scavenge, drag, and nail together what you can find to stay alive. Online co-op, in or out of VR. Play the demo at Steam Next Fest, Oct 19 to 26. Wishlist and follow to get notified the moment it is live.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T21:35:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1587920-4246335198905719400","game_id":"steam-1587920","kind":"update","title":"UD2 Demo Update","summary":"Hey everyone, I've been working on getting a build to share and was hoping to get into the Next Fest event that starts tomorrow. I've been making a lot of progress but there are too many missing and broken aspects to the demo right now. I'm going to hold off on a public demo for now. BUT I am going to be doing a private beta instead for anyone who is interested in getting an early look at the game. You can request a beta key through the UD Discord: https://discord.gg/f66RkePw8s Just post in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2022-02-21T04:50:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4246335198905719400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1587920-4224936215385035085","game_id":"steam-1587920","kind":"update","title":"UD2 Release update and Demo","summary":"Hey everyone I wanted to give you all an update on how things are looking with UD2. Unfortunately, I haven't been making progress as fast as I had hoped so I will be targeting a new release date of Q2 2022. I'm also going to be trying to get a demo ready for the upcoming Steam Next Fest in February. I'm nervous about announcing the demo because I'm not 100% sure if I'll be able to get it ready in time. Getting to share a build with you all and collect feedback would be amazing so I'm going to tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2021-12-02T22:04:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4224936215385035085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1587920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1587920":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1587920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z"},"1915280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:38Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1587920","app_id":1587920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context"